    "updated_at": "2016-03-14T10:25:17Z",
    "body": "An additional problem is that in Blink this is a `DOMStringList`, and the `item()` method has higher usage than allows for immediate removal:\nhttps://www.chromestatus.com/metrics/feature/timeline/popularity/847\nhttps://www.chromestatus.com/metrics/feature/timeline/popularity/849 (`contains()` looks better)\n\nStill, might as well spec it the way it should work if it can be an array in the end.\n",
