    "created_at": "2016-03-14T13:50:37Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-03-14T13:50:37Z",
    "body": "I have updated the PR, but honestly the result is kind of tortured. It's the exception that pushed me in a direction that's more complicated than any other `[SameObject]` attribute. WebIDL says \"the same value must always be returned\", not \"unless an exception is thrown.\" But by that interpretation, what I've done still doesn't make sense because `[SameObject]` is still used in the IDL.\n\nSo... I suck at this?\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
