    "updated_at": "2016-03-15T16:45:49Z",
    "body": "This LGTM with a nit. It doesn't seem tortured at all, to be honest.\n\nI'm really not sure what the intent of [SameObject] is, or whether its creators thought through the exception behavior. It seems like more of an implementation annotation than anything else; it should be the job of the prose to ensure the same object is returned each time.\n",
