    "created_at": "2016-03-16T13:51:53Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-03-16T13:51:53Z",
    "body": "We added `[SameObject]` at least in part because spec editors were doing a very poor job of saying in prose whether the object being returned was the same or new, and claimed they would have an easier time remembering to flag it in IDL...\n\nAnd yes, Gecko does use this as an optimization opportunity (e.g. to do CSE and LICM).\n",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
