    "updated_at": "2016-03-16T13:55:12Z",
    "body": "@foolip I think it's fine, is what I meant anyway. I do think IDL should make it more than a hint though. If IDL also defined slots and such it could provide guarantees here and implementations could use that for their implementation too.\n",
