    "created_at": "2016-03-16T14:07:00Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-03-16T14:07:00Z",
    "body": "Right, Gecko has a [Cached] IDL extended attribute which auto-generates a slot on the object and stores the JS value returned from the first call to the getter, thereby allowing us to enforce [SameObject] automatically if you use it in conjunction with [Cached].\n",
